## **📊 Quality Assurance Checklist**

### **Before Task Completion:**
- [ ] Task context retrieved and analyzed
- [ ] Existing knowledge searched and incorporated
- [ ] System state queried and validated
- [ ] Implementation approach documented
- [ ] Cross-system integration points recorded
- [ ] Testing strategy executed and documented
- [ ] Knowledge graph updated with findings
- [ ] Vector database populated with patterns
- [ ] Task status updated to "done"

### **Knowledge Quality Validation:**
- [ ] Implementation approach is searchable by relevant terms
- [ ] Architectural decisions are clearly documented
- [ ] Integration points are properly mapped
- [ ] Business value is articulated
- [ ] Reusable patterns are identified and stored
- [ ] Future considerations are noted

### **Cross-System Consistency:**
- [ ] Database changes are reflected in knowledge graph
- [ ] API modifications are documented with examples
- [ ] UI changes are linked to business processes
- [ ] Performance implications are noted
- [ ] Security considerations are addressed

